# Gitignored files that a parallel run needs in its own checkout. Claude Code
# copies a file listed here into every worktree it creates, but only when the
# file is gitignored as well — a pattern that is not is silently a no-op, so
# test-worktree.sh checks that every line here is one .gitignore covers.
#
# The telemetry env block lives in this file (see .gitignore), and without it
# a run in a worktree exports nowhere while the main checkout still does.
.claude/settings.local.json
